---
description: Permanent plaintiff-first stipulation drafting and review policy across all portfolio matters.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `internal/docs/STIPULATION_DEFENSE.md` for every stipulation or defense agreement. Draft the most plaintiff-favorable supported terms; maintain or shorten defense deadlines where advantageous while preserving Plaintiff's preparation time. Include a deadline comparison, concession audit, and plaintiff-favorable draft. Identify concrete Plaintiff benefit for any exception. Do not silently waive rights, expand defense options, authorize signatures, or treat proposed dates as operative. This applies to every current and future matter.
